<title>FRANCE: Three ships load 15,000t flour in Rouen for Cuba.</title>
<headline>Three ships load 15,000t flour in Rouen for Cuba.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three ships are loading a combined 15,000 tonnes of flour at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The flour is for export to west Africa and Cuba, they said.</p>
